{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20300","headline":"江南行 · 张籍","name":"江南行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江南人家多橘树，吴姬舟上织白苎。\n土地卑湿饶虫蛇，连木爲牌入江住。\n江村亥日长爲市，落帆度桥来蒲里。\n清莎覆城竹爲屋，无井家家饮潮水。\n长干午日沽春酒，高高酒旗悬江口。\n娼楼两岸临水栅，夜唱竹枝留北客。\n江南风土欢乐多，悠悠处处尽经过。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20300.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20300","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}